{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44923","headline":"赠王将军 · 无可","name":"赠王将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勳高绝少年，分卫玉阶前。\n雄勇明王重，温恭执友贤。\n功书唐史满，名到虏庭偏。\n劒彩浮龙影，衣香袭御烟。\n搜书秋霁阁，走马夕阳田。\n急兔投深草，瞋鹰下半天。\n野人盈邸第，朝客醉盘筵。\n位在将军列，官随宪府迁。\n刻心思报国，吁气欲开边。\n选帅如公议，须知少比肩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}